{"sectionId":"gene/transcription","items":[{"id":"gene--transcription-k001","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"RNA polymerase는 주형 DNA를 읽어 RNA를 5′→3′ 합성하며 보통 primer가 필요하지 않다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k002","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"세균 sigma factor는 promoter 인식을 돕는다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k003","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"진핵세포에서 RNA pol I은 대부분 rRNA, pol II는 mRNA 및 여러 조절 RNA, pol III는 tRNA와 5S rRNA 등을 합성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k004","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"일반 전사인자가 promoter에서 개시복합체를 형성하고 enhancer·silencer는 조절 단백질 결합을 통해 전사를 바꾼다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k005","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"pre-mRNA는 5′ 7-methylguanosine cap, splicing, 3′ cleavage 및 polyadenylation을 거친다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k006","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"spliceosome은 snRNP로 구성되며 일반적인 intron의 5′ GU, branch-point A, 3′ AG를 인식한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k007","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"branch-point A의 2′-OH가 첫 절단을 유도하여 lariat가 형성된다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k008","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"대체 스플라이싱은 한 유전자로부터 여러 RNA·단백질 형태를 만들 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k009","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"세균에서는 핵막이 없어 전사와 번역이 결합될 수 있다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k010","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"RNA pol II의 CTD 인산화는 전사와 RNA 가공의 조절에 중요하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k011","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"전사된 RNA는 주형 가닥과 상보적이고 coding 가닥과 U/T 차이를 제외하면 같은 방향 서열이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k012","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":"poly(A) 꼬리는 대개 주형에 직접 암호화된 긴 A 배열이 아니다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"gene--transcription-k013","sectionId":"gene/transcription","unitId":"gene","subject":"biology","text":